.
NLR
value
of
nonsurvival
group
(
median
:
49
.
06
;
interquartile
range
[
IQR
]
:
25
.
71-69
.
70
)
was
higher
than
that
of
survival
group
(
median
:
4
.
11
;
IQR
:
2
.
44-8
.
12
;
P
<
.
001
)
.
In
