culture
was
negative
at
day
10
.
All
but
one
,
were
PCR-cleared
at
day
15
.
A
poor
clinical
outcome
(
PClinO
)
was
observed
for
46
patients
(
4
.
3
%
)
and
8
died
(
0
.
75
%
)
(
74-95
years
old
)
.
All
