of
data
from
the
Genotype-Tissue
Expression
(
GTEx
)
project
revealed
that
the
expression
of
the
gene
encoding
the
enzyme
that
produces
KA
,
kynurenine
aminotransferase
,
correlated
with
cytokine
abundance
and
activation
of
immune
responses
in
older
males
.
This
study
reveals
that
KA
has
a
sex-specific
link
to
immune
responses
and
clinical
outcomes
in
COVID-19
,
suggesting
a
positive
feedback
between
metabolites
and
immune
responses
in
males
.
.
