the
main
ENT
subspecialties
.
Results
:
There
was
an
overall
increase
in
the
number
of
articles
by
the
42
.
2
%
in
2020
.
Publications
pertaining
Rhinology
and
Laryngology
increased
more
significantly
in
2020
,
