was
a
clinically
important
traumatic
brain
injury
or
representation
to
the
ED
.
Results
Of
the
1429
patients
screened
;
610
(
43
%
)
screened
negative
with
250
(
18
%
)
discharged
by
nursing
staff
.
Of
the
entire
cohort
,
32
CTs
were
performed
for
head
injury
concerns
(
6
abnormal
)
with
1
CT
performed
in
the
HIDAT
negative
group
(
normal
)
.
Of
