the
policy
with
later
medical
discharge
(
no
imaging
or
admission
)
.
Paediatric
ED
attendances
were
29
%
lower
than
in
2018
.
Conclusion
We
have
successfully
implemented
HIDAT
into
local
clinical
practice
.
The
number
discharged
(
18
%
)
is
lower
than
