dynamics
of
Covid-19
vaccine
transmission
in
Ethiopia
.
The
nonlinear
system
of
differential
equations
for
the
model
is
represented
using
Atangana-Baleanu
fractional
derivative
in
Caputo
sense
and
the
Jacobi
spectral
collocation
method
is
used
to
convert
this
system
into
an
algebraic
system
of
equations
,
which
is
then
solved
using
inexact
Newton's
method
.
The
fundamental
reproduction
number
,
for
the
proposed
model
is
determined
using
the
next
generation
matrix
approach
.
.
