medical
centers
(
92
.
0
%
,
23
/
25
)
and
metropolitan
hospitals
(
91
.
5
%
,
75
/
82
)
than
local
community
hospitals
(
48
.
8
%
,
178
/
365
)
doing
so
.
Visits
to
ordinary
wards
were
