rapid
prevention
and
treatment
of
COVID-19
.
However
,
analysis
to
fully
characterize
functional
SARS-CoV-2
mAbs
is
still
needed
.
In
this
study
,
by
interrogating
1
,
695
published
or
patented
mAbs
of
human
origin
and
validated
SARS-CoV-2-binding
potency
,
we
found
a
highly
preferential
usage
of
IGHV3-53
/
3-66
germline
genes
