###PMID=35280451
Trauma-Informed
Care
for
Hospitalized
Adolescents
Purpose
of
Review
Exposure
to
trauma
accelerates
during
the
adolescence
,
and
due
to
increased
behavioral
and
psychiatric
vulnerability
during
this
developmental
period
,
traumatic
events
during
this
time
are
more
likely
to
cause
a
lasting
impact
.
In
this
article
,
we
use
three
case
