patients
than
non-critical
patients
(
LV
LS
:
-
16
.
6
+
-
2
.
4
vs
-
17
.
9
+
-
3
.
0
,
P
=
.
003
;
RVFWLS
:
-
18
.
8
+
-
3
.
6
vs
-
23
.
9
+
-
4
.
4
,
P
<
.
001
)
.
During
a
