New
York
City
In
this
study
,
we
compared
the
risk
of
coronavirus
disease
2019
(
COVID-19
)
between
clinical
and
nonclinical
healthcare
workers
(
HCWs
)
while
adjusting
for
home
ZIP
codes
.
Clinical
HCWs
did
not
have
a
higher
risk
of
COVID-19
,
but
living
in
higher-risk
ZIP
codes
was
associated
with
