patients
compared
to
placebo
[
OR
=
1
.
63
;
95
%
CI
(
1
.
07-2
.
49
)
;
OR
=
1
.
64
95
%
CI
(
1
.
07-2
.
53
)
respectively
]
.
UC
patients
,
but
not
CD
patients
,
receiving
vedolizumab
had
a
higher
risk
to
develop
RTI
and
URTI
[
OR
=
1
.
98
;
95
%
CI
(
1
.
41-2
.
77
)
;
OR
=
2
.
02
;
95
%
CI
(
1
.
42-2
.
87
)
]
compared
