Automated
Western
immunoblotting
detection
of
anti-SARS-CoV-2
serum
antibodies
ELISA
and
chemiluminescence
serological
assays
for
COVID-19
are
currently
incorporating
only
one
or
two
SARS-CoV-2
antigens
.
We
developed
an
automated
Western
immunoblotting
as
a
complementary
serologic
assay
for
