IoT
technology
to
track
patients
'
health
statuses
.
Therefore
,
there
is
a
lack
of
understanding
on
how
to
utilize
such
technology
for
ICUs
'
medical
equipment
management
.
This
paper
proposes
a
novel
IoT-based
paradigm
called
IoT
Based
Paradigm
for
Medical
Equipment
Management
Systems
(
IoT
