.
We
described
in
detail
the
theoretical
and
practical
aspects
of
IoT
MEMS
.
Adopting
IoT
MEMS
will
enhance
hospital
capacity
and
capability
in
mitigating
COVID-19
efficiently
.
It
will
also
positively
influence
the
information
quality
of
(
THIS
)
and
strengthen
trust
and
transparency
among
