.
One
hundred
sixty-six
patients
(
103
males
;
age
43
.
8
+
-
12
.
3
years
)
were
allocated
in
the
training
cohort
and
72
patients
(
38
males
;
age
45
.
1
+
-
15
.
8
years
)
from
another
independent
hospital
were
