Social
Isolation
)
.
(
4
)
Conclusions
:
Women
from
ethnic
minority
backgrounds
experienced
disrupted
perinatal
mental
health
care
and
COVID-19
restrictions
compounding
their
mental
health
difficulties
.
Services
should
take
women's
circumstances
into
account
and
provide
flexibility
regarding
remote
delivery
of
care
.
.
