other
hand
,
the
dynamic
zero-inflated
Poisson
autoregressive
model
performed
better
than
the
dynamic
negative
binomial
autoregressive
model
.
The
predicted
new
death
based
on
the
zero-inflated
negative
binomial
autoregressive
model
indicated
that
Ghana's
COVID-19
death
per
day
will
rise
sharply
few
days
after
30th
November
2020
and
drastically
fall
just
as
in
the
observed
data
.
.
