pandemic
since
the
end
of
2019
.
It
is
a
transmissible
infection
caused
by
the
SARS-CoV-2
virus
.
The
highly
infectious
nature
of
this
illness
is
based
mostly
throughout
the
respiratory
tract
.
However
,
this
virus
can
affect
all
systems
of
the
human
body
,
such
as
the
gastrointestinal
tract
.
We
report
a
case
of
pancreatic
pseudocysts
as
a
late
manifestation
of
COVID-19
.
.
