acceptance
.
This
survey
study
assesses
veterans
'
attitudes
toward
and
intentions
to
receive
COVID-19
vaccines
.
Importance
Compared
with
the
general
population
,
veterans
are
at
high
risk
for
COVID-19
and
have
a
complex
relationship
with
the
government
.
This
potentially
affects
their
attitudes
toward
receiving
COVID-19
vaccines
.
Objective
To
assess
veterans
'
attitudes
toward
and
intentions
to
receive
COVID-19
vaccines
.
Design
,
Setting
,
and
Participants
This
