,
and
policy
and
processes
.
Results
Among
1178
respondents
,
974
(
83
%
)
were
men
,
130
(
11
%
)
were
women
,
and
141
(
12
%
)
were
transgender
or
nonbinary
;
58
respondents
(
5
%
)
were
Black
,
54
veterans
(
5
%
)
