.
The
digestive
system
is
the
main
target
organ
of
SARS-CoV-2
in
some
patients
.
Viral
excretion
of
SARS-CoV-2
in
feces
.
Management
of
patients
with
COVID-19
after
discharge
should
include
intestine
SARS-CoV-2
infection
.
The
current
reports
of
COVID-19
focus
on
the
respiratory
system
,
however
,
intestinal
infections
caused
by
SARS-CoV-2
are
also
worthy
of
