acute
respiratory
syndrome-related
coronavirus
2
(
SARS-CoV-2
)
has
now
caused
over
2
million
deaths
worldwide
and
continues
to
expand
.
Currently
,
much
is
unknown
about
functionally
neutralizing
human
antibody
responses
and
durability
to
SARS-CoV-2
months
after
infection
or
the
reason
for
the
discrepancy
in
COVID-19
disease
and
sex
.
Using
convalescent-phase
sera
collected
from
101
COVID-19-recovered
individuals
21
to
212
days
after
symptom
onset
with
48
additional
longitudinal
samples
,
we
measured
