delays
in
skin
cancer
treatments
.
We
present
a
male
patient
who
had
two
melanoma-in-situs
(
MISs
)
that
were
treated
during
the
COVID-19
pandemic
with
a
combination
of
topical
imiquimod
5
%
cream
,
5-fluorouracil
2
%
solution
,
and
tretinoin
0
.
1
%
cream
.
The
successful
