.
Moderate-severe
post-traumatic
stress
disorder
symptoms
were
found
in
45
.
1
%
(
95
%
confidence
interval
[
CI
]
40
.
2
%
-
50
.
1
%
)
of
all
staff
.
A
World
Health
Organisation-5
(
WHO-5
)
wellbeing
index
score
<
=
32
,
indicating
