Nursing
homes
experienced
steep
increases
in
COVID-19
cases
,
hospitalizations
,
and
deaths
during
the
final
quarter
of
2020
.
Four-fifths
(
80
.
51
%
;
n
=
10
,
592
)
of
facilities
reported
at
least
1
COVID-19
case
,
49
.
44
%
(
n
=
6504
)
reported
at
least
1
hospitalization
,
and
49
.
76
%
(
n
=
6546
)
reported
at
