.
The
median
Ct
value
of
HCW
was
23
.
2
,
and
84
.
6
%
(
11
/
13
)
had
a
Ct
value
<
=
34
.
The
median
Ct
value
of
29
.
0
among
outpatients
with
COVID-19
did
not
significantly
differ
from
HCW
.
In
contrast
,
inpatients
with
a
positive
SARS-CoV-2
test
had
a
median
Ct
value
of
34
.
0
(
p
=
0
.
003
)
,
which
translated
into
a
median
~
1
,
000-fold
lower
