.
The
ML
models
predicted
the
risk
of
death
(
Receiver
Operation
Characteristics
:
Area
Under
the
Curve
,
ROC-AUC
)
of
0
.
906
at
diagnosis
,
0
.
818
,
at
hospital
admission
and
0
.
721
at
Intensive
Care
Unit
(
ICU
)
