.
05
)
;
the
positivity
proportion
was
higher
for
Hispanics
(
26
.
9
%
;
95
%
CI
.
24
.
9-29
.
0
)
compared
to
Blacks
(
8
.
6
%
;
95
%
CI
,
7
.
6-9
.
7
)
or
Whites
(
5
.
8
%
;
95
%
CI
,
5
.
4-6
.
3
)
.
Individuals
reporting
