Pericarditis
Due
to
SARS-COV-2
in
a
Kidney
Transplant
Recipient
Severe
acute
respiratory
syndrome
coronavirus
2
(
SARS-CoV-2
)
is
highly
contagious
and
typically
presents
with
respiratory
complications
.
Non-respiratory
etiology
has
