.
Finally
,
all
patients
and
key
informants
agreed
that
SARS-CoV-2
negatively
affected
patients
'
adherence
to
their
DR
treatment
.
Hence
,
scaling
up
of
health
care
,
referral
,
and
appointment
setting
services
could
increase
the
uptake
of
treatment
and
retinal
screenings
among
