retrospective
study
We
aimed
to
assess
the
epidemiological
,
clinical
,
and
laboratory
characteristics
associated
with
mortality
among
hospitalized
Egyptian
patients
with
COVID-19
.
A
multicenter
,
retrospective
study
was
conducted
on
all
polymerase
chain
reaction
(
PCR
)
-
confirmed
COVID-19
cases
admitted
through
the
period
from
April
to
July
2020
.
A
generalized
linear
model
was
reconstructed
with
covariates
based
on
predictor's
statistical
significance
and
clinically
relevance
.
The
odds
ratio
(
OR
)
was
calculated
by
using
stepwise
logistic
regression
