.
In
addition
,
ACE2
and
CTSL
/
B
are
overexpressed
in
the
IFN-gamma
immune
subtype
of
ovarian
serous
Cystadenocarcinoma
(
OV
)
,
Cervical
squamous
cell
carcinoma
and
endocervical
adenocarcinoma
(
CESC
)
,
and
Bladder
urothelial
carcinoma
(
BLCA
)
.
Our
study
presents
a
bioinformatics
assessment
for
the
potential
risk
of
SARS-CoV-2
infection
in
pan-cancer
.
.
