,
Hubei
province
,
China
at
the
end
of
2019
.
With
the
spread
of
the
new
coronavirus
accelerating
,
person-to-person
transmission
in
family
homes
or
hospitals
,
and
intercity
spread
of
2019-nCoV
occurred
.
At
least
40
,
261
cases
confirmed
,
23
,
589
cases
suspected
,
909
cases
death
and
3444
cases
cured
in
China
and
worldwide
24
countries
confirmed
383
cases
being
diagnosed
,
1
case
death
in
February
10th
,
2020
.
At
present
,
the
mortality
of
2019-nCoV
in
China
is
2
.
3
%
,
compared
with
9
.
6
%
of
SARS
and
34
.
4
%
of
MERS
reported
by
WHO
.
It
seems
the
new
virus
