ability
of
NLR
.
722
COVID-19
,
2213
influenza
and
482
RSV
patients
were
included
.
Above
the
age
of
50
,
NLR
at
admission
was
significantly
lower
among
COVID-19
patients
(
P
<
0
.
001
)
.
NLR
was
associated
with
poor
clinical
outcome
only
in
