COVID-19
group
.
ROC
curve
analysis
was
performed
;
the
area
under
curve
of
poor
outcomes
for
COVID-19
was
0
.
68
,
compared
with
0
.
57
and
0
.
58
for
Influenza
and
RSV
respectively
.
In
the
COVID-19
group
,
