representative
sample
)
,
we
examined
if
vaccination
requirements
are
likely
to
backfire
,
as
commonly
feared
.
We
investigated
if
relative
to
encouraging
free
choice
in
vaccination
,
requiring
a
vaccine
weakens
or
strengthens
