###PMID=32681166
SARS-CoV-2
Infection-Associated
Hemophagocytic
Lymphohistiocytosis
Abstract
Objectives
A
subset
of
coronavirus
disease
2019
(
COVID-19
)
patients
exhibit
clinical
features
of
cytokine
storm
.
However
,
clinicopathologic
features
diagnostic
of
hemophagocytic
lymphohistiocytosis
(
HLH
)
have
not
