pulmonary
lesions
also
highlights
the
importance
of
antiretroviral
therapy
in
this
patient
.
This
report
provides
reference
for
the
diagnosis
and
treatment
of
HIV-infected
patients
with
COVID-19
.
This
article
is
protected
by
copyright
.
All
rights
reserved
.
.
