(
37
.
6
+
-
6
.
2
vs
30
.
5
+
-
4
.
0
,
P
<
.
001
)
.
Serum
albumin
level
was
inversely
correlated
to
white
blood
cell
(
r
=
-
.
149
,
P
=
.
01
)
and
neutrophil
to
