acute
respiratory
syndrome
coronavirus
2
(
SARS-CoV-2
)
had
emerged
in
2019
and
rapidly
posed
a
global
epidemic
.
Here
,
we
report
the
breadth
of
concomitant
virological
features
of
a
family
cluster
with
COVID-19
.
The
period
of
virus
shedding
is
significantly
different
between
