.
001
)
.
A
42
%
reduction
occurred
in
weekly
adult
procedures
(
median
before
,
62
;
IQR
,
54-70
;
median
during
,
36
;
IQR
,
34-39
;
P
<
0
.
001
)
,
and
a
31
%
reduction
occurred
in
weekly
pediatric
procedures
(
median
before
,
13
;
